{"n": 1295, "w": 1000, "h": 764, "img": "1295.webp", "text": "72-110\n\n7211030 REMOVING AND INSTALLING\nOR REPLACING FRONT SEAT\n\nBelt holder can be mounted in bore A or B\ndepending on size of person.\n\nBELT (COMPLETE) Cut out B pillar trim for bore B.\n\nC = approx. 50 mm (2).\n\nRemove and install front seat 52 10 000.\n\nPull off cap.\n\nDetach bottom belt strap (1).\n\nInstalfation:\n\nTightening torque\"\n\nTwo Door: Installed Order:\n\nLift out rear seat cushion from above, 1) Bolt\n\nUnserew bolts (1) and disconnect backrest in 2) Plastic washer\n\nholders (2) from above, 3) Top belt\n4) Plastic washer\n5) Washer (2x)\nTightening torque\"\nSince 1985 Models:\n\nWashers 2 and 4 omitted.\n\n30 72 013\n\nDisconnect side trim panel (3 clips) and pull Insert pin (1) and remove slide,\n\nup out of clamps.\n\nUnscrew bolt (1) and disconnect belt strap.\nUnscrew bolt (2) and remove automatic reel.\nInstallation:\n\nCentering pin engages in bore.\n\nTiahtenine torave*.\n\nPull off cap and unscrew bolt.\n\n* See Specifications * See Specifications", "words": [["72-110", 0.4651, 0.0192, 0.5399, 0.0443], ["7211030", 0.2604, 0.0655, 0.3099, 0.0761], ["REMOVING", 0.3231, 0.0642, 0.3827, 0.0761], ["AND", 0.3868, 0.0642, 0.41, 0.0761], ["INSTALLING", 0.4156, 0.0642, 0.4823, 0.0761], ["OR", 0.3231, 0.08, 0.3382, 0.0919], ["REPLACING", 0.3433, 0.08, 0.405, 0.0919], ["FRONT", 0.41, 0.08, 0.4479, 0.0906], ["SEAT", 0.452, 0.08, 0.4793, 0.0919], ["Belt", 0.7543, 0.0668, 0.7745, 0.0774], ["holder", 0.7786, 0.0668, 0.8089, 0.0774], ["can", 0.8119, 0.0681, 0.8291, 0.0761], ["be", 0.8322, 0.0668, 0.8433, 0.0761], ["mounted", 0.8473, 0.0668, 0.8898, 0.0761], ["in", 0.8938, 0.0681, 0.9019, 0.0761], ["bore", 0.906, 0.0655, 0.9277, 0.0761], ["A", 0.9307, 0.0655, 0.9388, 0.0761], ["or", 0.9419, 0.0681, 0.951, 0.0761], ["B", 0.955, 0.0655, 0.9611, 0.0761], ["depending", 0.7543, 0.0827, 0.8049, 0.0946], ["on", 0.8079, 0.0853, 0.82, 0.0933], ["size", 0.8241, 0.084, 0.8413, 0.0919], ["of",